<title>USA: Endocardial Solutions Inc offers shares.</title>
<headline>Endocardial Solutions Inc offers shares.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Endocardial Solutions Inc on Thursday said it offered three million common shares at $9 each as part of a previously announced initial public offer.</p>
<p>The company said 2.25 million shares were offered to the public and 750,000 shares were offered in a concurrent private sale to Medtronic Inc.</p>
<p>Endocardial Solutions is developing a cardiac diagnostic system to improve monitoring and assessment of abnormally rapid heartbeats.</p>
<p>Its shares closed unchanged Thursday at 9.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
